OL,9,FA paedophile who wanted to video call
OL,10,Fand watch a 10-year-old girl being
OL,11,Fraped by her grandfather has been
OL,12,Fjailed for nine years.
OL,14,FChristopher Lumley, 38, was already
OL,15,Funder investigation after the FBI found
OL,16,Fchats he had with a fellow child sex
OL,17,Foffender in the USA when he was caught
OL,18,Fby an undercover officer posing as an
OL,19,Fabusive grandparent, Teesside Crown
OL,20,FCourt heard.
